{"metadata":{"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"slug":[{"Plain":"tangle-ribbon-cat"},0],"title":[{"Plain":"由带状范畴染色的标架缠结"},2]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2>观念</h2>\n<p>由范畴 $\\mathcal C$ 染色的"},{"Local":{"url":"缠结","text":"标架缠结"}},{"Plain":"范畴 $\\mathcal T (\\mathcal C)$ 是 $\\mathcal C$ "},{"Local":{"url":"自由-遗忘伴随","text":"自由"}},{"Plain":"生成的"},{"Local":{"url":"带状范畴","text":"带状范畴"}},{"Plain":". 当 $\\mathcal C$ 本身为"},{"Local":{"url":"带状范畴","text":"带状范畴"}},{"Plain":"时, 有结构函子 $\\mathcal T(\\mathcal C) \\to \\mathcal C$.</p>\n<p>当然, 无染色的标架"},{"Local":{"url":"缠结","text":"缠结"}},{"Plain":"范畴本身可视为 $\\mathcal C = 1$ 的特殊情形.</p>\n<h2>定义</h2>\n<p>设 $\\mathcal C$ 为"},{"Local":{"url":"带状范畴","text":"带状范畴"}},{"Plain":", 定义由 $\\mathcal C$ 染色的"},{"Local":{"url":"缠结","text":"缠结"}},{"Plain":"范畴 $\\mathcal T(\\mathcal C)$ 如下:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>其对象为 $(A,\\varepsilon) := ((A_1,\\varepsilon_1),\\cdots,(A_n,\\varepsilon_n))$, $A_i\\in\\mathcal C$, $\\varepsilon_i \\in \\{\\pm 1\\}$,</li>\n<li>态射 $(A,\\varepsilon)\\to (B,\\varepsilon')$ 为由 $\\mathcal C$ 的态射染色的"},{"Local":{"url":"缠结","text":"标架缠结"}},{"Plain":", 缠结端点处标架的方向符合 $\\varepsilon,\\varepsilon'$ 的符号.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>范畴 $\\mathcal T(\\mathcal C)$ 带有直观的"},{"Local":{"url":"带状范畴","text":"带状范畴"}},{"Plain":"结构:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>幺半结构即为并置,</li>\n<li>辫结构即为交换两股线的缠结,</li>\n<li>带状结构中的扭即为扭转缠结,</li>\n<li>"},{"Local":{"url":"对偶(范畴论)","text":"对偶"}},{"Plain":"是反转正负号 $\\varepsilon$.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>性质</h2>\n<h3>生成元</h3>\n<p>和"},{"Local":{"url":"缠结","text":"缠结"}},{"Plain":"范畴类似, 染色缠结范畴由基本缠结生成.</p>\n"}]}}